{"page":21,"verses":[{"verse_key":"2:135","surah":2,"ayah":135,"ar_uthmani":"وَقَالُوا۟ كُونُوا۟ هُودًا أَوْ نَصَـٰرَىٰ تَهْتَدُوا۟ ۗ قُلْ بَلْ مِلَّةَ إِبْرَٰهِـۧمَ حَنِيفًا ۖ وَمَا كَانَ مِنَ ٱلْمُشْرِكِينَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"They say, ‘Become Jews or Christians, and you will be rightly guided.’ Say [Prophet], ‘No, [ours is] the religion of Abraham, the upright, who did not worship any god besides God.’","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَقَالُوا۟","en_gloss":"And they said","transliteration":"waqālū","verse_key":"2:135"},{"pos":2,"ar":"كُونُوا۟","en_gloss":"Be","transliteration":"kūnū","verse_key":"2:135"},{"pos":3,"ar":"هُودًا","en_gloss":"Jews","transliteration":"hūdan","verse_key":"2:135"},{"pos":4,"ar":"أَوْ","en_gloss":"or","transliteration":"aw","verse_key":"2:135"},{"pos":5,"ar":"نَصَـٰرَىٰ","en_gloss":"Christians","transliteration":"naṣārā","verse_key":"2:135"},{"pos":6,"ar":"تَهْتَدُوا۟ ۗ","en_gloss":"(then) you will be guided","transliteration":"tahtadū","verse_key":"2:135"},{"pos":7,"ar":"قُلْ","en_gloss":"Say","transliteration":"qul","verse_key":"2:135"},{"pos":8,"ar":"بَلْ","en_gloss":"Nay","transliteration":"bal","verse_key":"2:135"},{"pos":9,"ar":"مِلَّةَ","en_gloss":"(the) religion","transliteration":"millata","verse_key":"2:135"},{"pos":10,"ar":"إِبْرَٰهِـۧمَ","en_gloss":"(of) Ibrahim","transliteration":"ib'rāhīma","verse_key":"2:135"},{"pos":11,"ar":"حَنِيفًۭا ۖ","en_gloss":"(the) upright","transliteration":"ḥanīfan","verse_key":"2:135"},{"pos":12,"ar":"وَمَا","en_gloss":"and not","transliteration":"wamā","verse_key":"2:135"},{"pos":13,"ar":"كَانَ","en_gloss":"he was","transliteration":"kāna","verse_key":"2:135"},{"pos":14,"ar":"مِنَ","en_gloss":"of","transliteration":"mina","verse_key":"2:135"},{"pos":15,"ar":"ٱلْمُشْرِكِينَ","en_gloss":"those who associated partners (with Allah)","transliteration":"l-mush'rikīna","verse_key":"2:135"},{"pos":16,"ar":"١٣٥","en_gloss":"(135)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"2:135"}]},{"verse_key":"2:136","surah":2,"ayah":136,"ar_uthmani":"قُولُوٓا۟ ءَامَنَّا بِٱللَّهِ وَمَآ أُنزِلَ إِلَيْنَا وَمَآ أُنزِلَ إِلَىٰٓ إِبْرَٰهِـۧمَ وَإِسْمَـٰعِيلَ وَإِسْحَـٰقَ وَيَعْقُوبَ وَٱلْأَسْبَاطِ وَمَآ أُوتِىَ مُوسَىٰ وَعِيسَىٰ وَمَآ أُوتِىَ ٱلنَّبِيُّونَ مِن رَّبِّهِمْ لَا نُفَرِّقُ بَيْنَ أَحَدٍ مِّنْهُمْ وَنَحْنُ لَهُۥ مُسْلِمُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"So [you believers], say, ‘We believe in God and in what was sent down to us and what was sent down to Abraham, Ishmael, Isaac, Jacob, and the Tribes, and what was given to Moses, Jesus, and all the prophets by their Lord. We make no distinction between any of them, and we devote ourselves to Him.’","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"قُولُوٓا۟","en_gloss":"Say","transliteration":"qūlū","verse_key":"2:136"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ءَامَنَّا","en_gloss":"We have believed","transliteration":"āmannā","verse_key":"2:136"},{"pos":3,"ar":"بِٱللَّهِ","en_gloss":"in Allah","transliteration":"bil-lahi","verse_key":"2:136"},{"pos":4,"ar":"وَمَآ","en_gloss":"and what","transliteration":"wamā","verse_key":"2:136"},{"pos":5,"ar":"أُنزِلَ","en_gloss":"(is) revealed","transliteration":"unzila","verse_key":"2:136"},{"pos":6,"ar":"إِلَيْنَا","en_gloss":"to us","transliteration":"ilaynā","verse_key":"2:136"},{"pos":7,"ar":"وَمَآ","en_gloss":"and what","transliteration":"wamā","verse_key":"2:136"},{"pos":8,"ar":"أُنزِلَ","en_gloss":"was revealed","transliteration":"unzila","verse_key":"2:136"},{"pos":9,"ar":"إِلَىٰٓ","en_gloss":"to","transliteration":"ilā","verse_key":"2:136"},{"pos":10,"ar":"إِبْرَٰهِـۧمَ","en_gloss":"Ibrahim","transliteration":"ib'rāhīma","verse_key":"2:136"},{"pos":11,"ar":"وَإِسْمَـٰعِيلَ","en_gloss":"and Ishmael","transliteration":"wa-is'māʿīla","verse_key":"2:136"},{"pos":12,"ar":"وَإِسْحَـٰقَ","en_gloss":"and Isaac","transliteration":"wa-is'ḥāqa","verse_key":"2:136"},{"pos":13,"ar":"وَيَعْقُوبَ","en_gloss":"and Yaqub","transliteration":"wayaʿqūba","verse_key":"2:136"},{"pos":14,"ar":"وَٱلْأَسْبَاطِ","en_gloss":"and the descendants","tra